    "Sound Check adjusts the loudness between different sounds to play at the same volume." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Sound Check toggle, which normalizes loudness across different sounds.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sound Check passt die Lautheit verschiedener Sounds an, damit sie mit derselben Lautstärke abgespielt werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sound Check adjusts the loudness between different sounds to play at the same volume."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sound Check adjusts the loudness between different sounds to play at the same volume."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sound Check ajusta el volumen entre diferentes sonidos para que se reproduzcan al mismo nivel."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sound Check ajuste la sonie entre différents sons pour qu’ils soient lus au même volume."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "A Sound Check úgy állítja be a különböző hangok hangerejét, hogy azonos szinten szóljanak."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sound Check regola la sonorità tra i diversi suoni per riprodurli allo stesso volume."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "サウンドチェックは、異なるサウンド間の音量を調整して、同じ音量で再生されるようにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "사운드 체크는 서로 다른 소리의 음량을 조정하여 같은 음량으로 재생되도록 합니다."
